title: "[Beslisboom] CreateMapPattern" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
q0: "Map/ProjectTo van\nAutoMapper?" {shape: diamond}
m0: "Manual: not migrated yet\n(map-call)"
q1: "one profile in the outermost type,\nnot generic/partial, one constructor?" {shape: diamond}
m1: "Manual: several profiles, generic,\npartial or several constructors\n(profile-shapes)"
q2: "elk statement\nCreateMap<A, B>()?" {shape: diamond}
m2: "Manual: not a CreateMap\nwithout options (options)"
q3: "B publieke parameterloze\nconstructor, niet abstract?" {shape: diamond}
m3: "Manual: no public parameterless\nconstructor (constructor)"
q4: "elk schrijfbaar lid: bronlid\nmet exact dezelfde naam?" {shape: diamond}
m4: "Manual: no member with the\nsame name (flattening)"
q5: "zelfde type,\ngeen collectie?" {shape: diamond}
m5: "Manual: AutoMapper converts\n(conversion) / is a collection (collection)"
q6: "A, B publiek of internal,\n<Profile>Extensions vrij?" {shape: diamond}
m6: "Manual: private/protected\nof naam bestaat al"
f: "Fixed: leeg profile +\nstatic B ToB(this A source)\n(simple, internal-types)"
